id: pm-linear-focused-closure
title: Read the bounded missing Linear prerequisite frontier
description: "Acquire Linear-specific missing prerequisite context for explicitly selected linked pm items. Overlap recheck: core deps and pm-graph analyze available relationships; pm-context packages available neighborhoods. None fetches the selected Linear inverse blocks frontier. No graph analytics or full-team import."
type: Feature
status: in_progress
priority: 2
tags: []
created_at: "2026-10-25T23:23:46.739Z"
updated_at: "2026-10-26T02:16:36.619Z"
author: codex-agent
acceptance_criteria: "A three-hop fixture yields the exact frontier within declared node and HTTP request caps; inaccessible blockers remain unresolved boundaries; preview writes nothing. Typed SDK and CLI emit compact TOON/JSON, typed refusals with remedies, documented non-git operation, adversarial boundaries and read-only public tracker validation. CI npm and Bun release gates pass unchanged thresholds."
comments[6]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-25T23:24:03.730Z",codex-agent,"Overlap rechecked against current core SDK dependency/provenance APIs, pm-graph offline analytics/blocker cuts and pm-context neighborhood packing. Those consume available relations. This feature only acquires missing Linear inverse blocks context for explicit existing item selections, with no import/apply mode, journals, shared mutable budgets or status classification. Use certified complete SDK reads and existing provenance parsing; count actual HTTP attempts without hidden retries; reject malformed or oversized boundary data."
  "2026-10-25T23:30:21.766Z",codex-agent,"Implemented typed read-only acquisition and CLI. Three-hop traversal, four cap classes, inaccessible/null blockers, paging drift/direction/duplicates, extreme inputs, concurrent independent previews and peer edits at each of four HTTP boundaries now pass targeted checks. Found pinned SDK reads persist usage/cache files; added an owned bounded disposable read mirror, retaining SDK corpus certification without any source-tracker writes. No provider mutations or import/apply plans are introduced."
  "2026-10-26T02:07:03.282Z",codex-agent,"Validation: six focused examples pass; behavioral revert of prerequisite acquisition fails the three-hop regression as required. Public main snapshot b437db2 has 107 items and zero Linear links: selection refusal performs 0 HTTP requests. Separate SDK-seeded read-only public-derived copy has one synthetic link, reads 4 fixture nodes and 3 relations in 4 requests, emits 789 JSON bytes, and both corpus hashes remain unchanged. Strengthened 500-sequence model includes native fields, a relationship and randomized custom status registries. No live Linear-account claim. Typecheck, test typecheck, docstring lint and diff whitespace checks pass."
  "2026-10-26T02:09:31.351Z",codex-agent,"Additional regression: read-only source permissions now pass without source writes; foreign symlinks and unreadable item documents produce bounded local-read refusals. pm test --run --progress passed the linked three-hop command (1 test, zero failures). SDK read-side cache/usage persistence is isolated in disposable mirrors; report as an SDK observational-read limitation, without filing upstream work."
  "2026-10-26T02:10:58.298Z",codex-agent,Model test uses SDK locateItem/readLocatedItem for authoritative read-back to avoid repeatedly appending high-level get usage feedback during 1000 previews. This preserves the independent reachability oracle and native-state comparison while reducing shared-host overhead. Implementation and public-copy validation are committed; full release evidence will come from the CI npm/Bun matrix.
  "2026-10-26T02:16:32.561Z",codex-agent,"PR ready: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-linear/pull/177. Latest targeted model passed: 500 seeded sequences / 1000 previews with native fields, blocked_by relationship, historical graph replays and random custom lifecycle registries; 1 property test passed, zero fail/skip/cancel. Six focused examples plus two additional read-only/strict-schema examples pass. Current global CLI 2026.10.25 dependency/provenance contracts were also rechecked: no Linear prerequisite acquisition overlap. Local typechecks, docstring lint, changelog check and pm-linked three-hop test pass. CI release-gate npm/Bun runs remain the required full-suite evidence; monitor the final pushed head."
